        "notes": "Round 1 and 2 is all about getting your cash as much as possible and thats from doing damage, and healing yourself. Do not worry about losing the rounds. So we are going to go for items that gives us damage as well as some survivability for round 1.  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) will help more since you will be using your gun more often. try your best to land your shots with your right click. Mei's headshots deal a ton of damage. We will then add  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) so you can tank a bit more damage and cryo before you die. Lets hope it doesn't get to that.\n\nPLAYSTYLE: Drop your walls in the middle of the enemies. If you can separate the healers from the team by blocking line of sight, that would be good enough. Do this for Round 1 and Round 2.",
